whatly (6.7.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Lower idle memory: V8 starts in optimize-for-size mode by default, with a
    Settings toggle and a JS heap limit (#15).
  * Monochrome tray icon now applies with no unread messages, not only when a
    count is shown (#14).
  * Adding a second account is discoverable: account bar with its "+" shows
    with a single account, plus a tray "Add account…" entry.
  * Never strand the window when the tray icon is hidden (#13).
  * Windows build and start-up fixes: spell-check tool lookup (#18) and
    launching from the system directory (#19).
